            "a": "<p>Visit /pages/stockist and submit the wholesale form. Our team reviews each application within 5 business days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q29": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What are the wholesale terms?",
            "a": "<p>Standard terms include 50%+ wholesale margin, MSRP guidance, and Net-30 payment for established accounts. Full terms are shared after a discovery call.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q30": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What's the minimum order quantity?",
            "a": "<p>Minimum first order is 50 units across our range. Reorders have a lower minimum once you're an approved partner.</p>"
          }
